        "verse": 8
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "2KI",
          "chapter": 16,
          "verse": 8
        }
      ],
      "en": "Ahaz took the silver and gold that was found in the LORD’s house, and in the treasures of the king’s house, and sent it for a present to the king of Assyria.",
      "ko": "여호와의 전과 왕궁 곳간에 있는 은금을 취하여 앗수르 왕에게 예물로 보내었더니",
      "source_text_hash": "9ba7c3c34ae85621b29194baaaaf3398841dd17e54eada74137ae111bd09da2c",
      "translation_text_hash": "d93c6744f0227f698a9a2c993314c4a14cbc453fc79d6271fcdfefb5a4b826e5",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "여호와의 전과 왕궁 곳간에 있는 은금을 취하여 앗수르 왕에게 예물로 보내었더니"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "d93c6744f0227f698a9a2c993314c4a14cbc453fc79d6271fcdfefb5a4b826e5"
